GLEIF town-level address corpus

The queries and postcodes in tests/gold.gleif.seeds.jsonl and
tests/gold.gleif.jsonl are taken from the GLEIF LEI Golden Copy (legal addresses
of legal entities), provided by the Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation
under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) per its LEI
Data Terms of Use (https://www.gleif.org/en/meta/lei-data-terms-of-use). This
corpus is not provided, supported, authorized or endorsed by GLEIF or any LEI
issuer; GLEIF does not warrant the data's accuracy. The file used, its size and
SHA-256 are recorded in tests/gleif/manifest.json.

Expected points and ISO 3166-2 codes come from Wikidata (CC0 1.0,
https://www.wikidata.org/), as recorded per case.
